{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "问题没问好导致孩子讨厌交谈", "content": "如果问题没问好，孩子会觉得与人交谈费力、讨厌。例如，父母利用机会教育孩子，孩子会觉得谈话像挖坑让自己跳，然后被教育，因此讨厌与人打交道。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["交谈", "讨厌", "教育"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-18a5df5d1f41", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:u0017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "consequence", "title": "问错问题的第五个后果：孩子上瘾", "content": "问错问题可能导致孩子上瘾。因为失联让孩子对人不感兴趣甚至厌恶，孩子会寻找其他东西进行联系，如游戏、网络。讲师说明问错问题不止这五个危险，但这五个最明显。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["依赖与失控"], "tags": ["上瘾", "失联", "后果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-18a5df5d1f41", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a019", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "reason": "“问错问题的第五个后果：孩子上瘾”与“游戏中的提问与父母提问的对比”相关，后者解释前者上瘾的原因，原方向相反。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向错误，改为关联。"}, {"target": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a021", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "reason": "“问错问题的第五个后果：孩子上瘾”与“网络世界吸引孩子”均涉及孩子被网络吸引，但因果方向应为网络吸引导致上瘾，原边因果类型无效且方向相反。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原causes类型无效，改为关联。"}, {"target": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a022", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "reason": "“问错问题的第五个后果：孩子上瘾”与“预防孩子上瘾的建议”属于同一议题，后者为预防措施而非对前者的支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "改为关联。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:u0018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "游戏中的提问与父母提问的对比", "content": "游戏里会问很多问题，但游戏中的问题不像父母问的那么无聊。父母会问无聊问题如“今天学校怎么样”和“今天晚上想吃什么”；游戏不关心这些，但父母关心。不是不要问无聊问题，而是需要问，但生活中的提问不能只有或大部分是无聊问题，大部分应该是有趣的问题。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["依赖与失控"], "tags": ["游戏", "提问", "无聊问题"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-18a5df5d1f41", "blocks": ["b00016", "b00017", "b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a020", "kind": "supports", "condition": "当提问应包含有趣问题时", "reason": "“游戏中的提问与父母提问的对比”指出提问不能只有无聊问题，大部分应是有趣问题，支持“提问应包含有趣的问题”的观点。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:r001", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "reason": "“游戏中的提问与父母提问的对比”与“无聊问题与有趣问题的区分”相关，后者提供定义支持前者，原方向相反。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向错误，改为关联。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:u0019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "recommendation", "title": "提问应包含有趣的问题", "content": "对孩子的提问不能只有无聊的问题，也不能大部分是无聊的问题，大部分应该是有趣的、有意思的问题，以产生连接。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["提问", "有趣问题", "连接"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-18a5df5d1f41", "blocks": ["b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:r001", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:u0020", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-18a5df5d1f41-c001:u0020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
